# Null-test case for the delay golden render with tempo sync (Story 2.11): the golden test-tone MIDI with part 0 sending to the delay (dotted eighth, tempo 100 bpm
# changing to 140 bpm at 0.5 s through a tempo_bpm performance event, feedback 0.55, damping 0.3), then a 1.5 s tail. -100 dB residual: far below the audible
# effect of the settings, loose enough for libm/FMA differences between macOS and Linux builds. check_excess: a tail in one file only fails as well.
reference=fx_delay_sync.wav
tolerance_db=-100
max_offset_frames=0
max_length_diff_frames=0
check_excess=1
